"\"Accepted\" means the site handed the message off without complaint. It "
"cannot tell you the message was delivered, or read - no sender can."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wpcpm-admin.php:1007
msgid "Required"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wpcpm-admin.php:1008
msgid "Reading mentors, students and tutors."
msgstr ""

