msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wpcpm-admin.php:1013
msgid ""
"Changing a mentor's status when you promote them. Without it the tool can "
"still run in report-only mode, but promoting fails."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wpcpm-admin.php:1017
msgid "Optional"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wpcpm-admin.php:1018
msgid ""
"Reading each column's description from Airtable. Without it the built-in "
"descriptions are shown instead."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wpcpm-admin.php:1022
msgid "Token scopes"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wpcpm-admin.php:1037
msgid ""
"Set these on the token itself at airtable.com/create/tokens, and give it "
"access to the WPCredits base. Scopes cannot be checked from here without "
"writing to the base, so this list is the reference."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wpcpm-admin.php:1051
msgid "Tool: Mentor Status Checker"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wpcpm-admin.php:1052
